units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

region box block 0.0 20.0 0.0 20.0 0.0 20.0
create_box 2 box

mass 1 15.999
mass 2 1.008

create_atoms 1 single 10.000 10.000 10.000
create_atoms 2 single 10.957 10.000 10.000
create_atoms 2 single 9.761 10.927 10.000
replicate 100 50 7

pair_style deepmd ${dp_test}
pair_coeff * * O H

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix 1 all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1

timestep 0.0005
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press

dump 1 all custom 10 water_phase.lammpstrj id type x y z

run 100
